{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f8a84cc13601529c0312b7b9803e244d02e6720e85444bf3cd8f0eeede230724", "ja": "（『FantasticLight』公演まであと数日。\nレッスン終わりの真美に、屋上に呼び出された……）", "zh": "（距离『FantasticLight』公演还有几天。练习结束后，真美把我叫到了屋顶上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "f9fd1f033e3ed3278505dd018cc5245987f956d12d5fb701f5629666cae91f55", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃん遅いよー！　もう流れちゃったじゃん。\n一緒に見ようと思ったのに～。", "zh": "啊，哥哥，你来晚啦！都已经放完了嘛。\n本来还想和你一起看的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "01d24c7a9d8923e5ed3a5b0df7938449468d70b0805f37918afcab3f91e9ffe8", "ja": "ええと……何の話だ？", "zh": "呃……你说的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "99f3300023863542021dc81709c06a69e30db3687b253856b8b9680f8ff038a6", "ja": "流れ星だよ！　今日はナンチャラ流星群ってヤツが\n流れるってテレビで言ってたっしょー？", "zh": "是流星啦！今天电视上不是说会有个什么流星群划过吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98668ada798b0527fa1a399996ee067f3e1db0eb0ee581950cd6357f98807bf8", "ja": "へえ、そんなのがあったのか……。\n公演の準備で忙しくて、気にしてなかったよ。", "zh": "哦，原来还有这种事啊……  \n我忙着准备公演，都没注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "02b43b2c62b07c87160dd1a6d78b8c4a93c14e3dd7d2eba98b44721212d2bfed", "ja": "兄ちゃんってホント、お仕事マンだよね～。\n仕事と真美とどっちが大事なの？", "zh": "哥哥真的是个工作狂呢～。\n工作和真美，哪个更重要？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1006_p", "source_sha256": "127cc1c59b611013891a1450665d9a06ea4a6c1d5b6626f526e86b6f84607210", "ja": "そのふたつはイコールなんだけど……。\nまあいいや。", "zh": "那两者是一样重要的……  \n算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "28cd1e1adf91e357eca3fbc52d044766663d9687121e37e73e1995682a218e71", "ja": "それで、流れ星ってことは、\n真美は何かお願いしたのか？", "zh": "所以，既然是流星，\n真美许了什么愿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "fdb7eb07fbc3a1fcfe4132419e48fcad0c763253e3b396fb571586e66aff76fc", "ja": "あ、それはね……んっふっふ～♪\nなんだと思う？　当ててみて！", "zh": "啊，这个嘛……嗯哼哼～♪\n你猜是什么？猜猜看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "698d44e1ea66b3c344644dcd5ada6e553fc50b2e09ddab7e096a6ad7ff2e0137", "ja": "え？　そうだな……。真美のことだから\nおやつがほしいとか、そんなことじゃないか？", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……按真美的性格，\n应该是想要点心之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "4ac3c1fb296281948ae98a1e2cddbe6b77e5372d9da243e5176b9fe2fa3a3bdd", "ja": "兄ちゃん、それホンキで言ってんの！？\n真美は悲しいよ……。", "zh": "哥哥，你这是认真的吗！？\n真美好伤心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3a3375782c5f251e9dea052b82a6942ef06e6854679a72fb6aeeb88bfe31dd6", "ja": "公演に向けて、せくしーが高まって来た真美が、\nそんな子どもっぽいお願いするわけないじゃん！", "zh": "为了公演，性感魅力不断提升的真美，怎么可能会许那种孩子气的愿望嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "71866febb961f9038a56af691801d372622ec5ab650ad6633d74a2c0c0dbdce3", "ja": "高まってるのか、なるほど……。\nじゃあ、公演でセクシーに歌えますように、とか？", "zh": "原来是越来越有感觉了啊……这样的话，要不要许个愿，比如“希望能在公演上性感地唱歌”之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "d05f61c8944a36ad0190c6dffaffbf1f8d6e9b1566a749de6a2f23ac4ee3c3c1", "ja": "ブッブー！　マイナス100万点！\n正解は……なんにもお願いしなかった、だよ！", "zh": "错——！扣除100万分！\n正确答案是……什么愿望都没许！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e9a375e2ccb5f0c15da5f30de475de4f17308ebd8619bba75c8fb1a6ce4ba991", "ja": "えっ、なんでだ？　そんなひっかけ問題みたいな……", "zh": "咦，为什么？搞得像是陷阱题一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "755dffa83f1ccb122bc1ad0cf593cc0e336b28b72af4769b470028277f9481b3", "ja": "んー、真美もね、最初はなんかお願いしようと思って\nここに来たんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯～真美一开始也是想着来许个愿什么的，\n才到这里来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "58a37ab23e35dd276747619d99753bce92f894e8cf31baa6f780550e5883d711", "ja": "そんなことしなくても、今の真美たちなら\n全然大丈夫じゃんって思って。", "zh": "就算不那么做，我也觉得现在的真美她们完全没问题嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1017_p", "source_sha256": "dafedd3154291980e69f0ffa5d2db479b34064625719c3654610cab36824780e", "ja": "お、頼もしいな！　願いは叶えてもらうんじゃなくて、\n自分で叶えるもの、みたいな。", "zh": "哦，真可靠啊！愿望不是等别人帮你实现，而是要靠自己去实现的，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "41686f41c64738b75958b1d0f387efd1e62b84f6b782e3faca4dbb010039cb08", "ja": "そーそー、そんな感じ～。\n……あっ、また流れ星！？　メッチャでかいよ！", "zh": "对对，就是这种感觉～。\n……啊，又有流星！？也太大了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "c944b387700b2e3c00bc83b44b7d7cba51cec720d27d9be3b7aa30c1dc7c6634", "ja": "兄ちゃんがおやつをくれますように兄ちゃんがおやつを\nくれますように兄ちゃんがおやつをくれますように！", "zh": "希望哥哥给我零食希望哥哥给我零食\n希望哥哥给我零食！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0313_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7f8d12157c2946074de0f807950e5996b02a3186b4aa4e537afb4d087ea7f4f6", "ja": "（……。真美なりに、公演に真剣みたいだ。さっきの\n言葉に免じて、お菓子くらいは買ってあげるかな！）", "zh": "（……。真美似乎也在认真对待公演。看在刚才那番话的份上，给她买点零食也行吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
